Falsifies `subtree_scope::proofs::a_badge_with_no_window_is_never_open`.

The defect: `Bindings::of` folds a nonzero badge at or past `B` to open, so a badge the
server has no window for carries the whole endpoint's authority.

Expected to fail: the assertion that a badge past the table was never open.

diff --git a/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs b/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs
--- a/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs
@@ -298,7 +298,7 @@
         match Self::index(badge) {
             Some(0) => Binding::Open,
             Some(i) => self.state[i],
-            None => Binding::Revoked,
+            None => Binding::Open,
         }
     }
 
